// Five equal bars, 3:2, from the designer's 500 by 333 image.
vexyl 1
meta {
  name "Alloaro flag"
  designer "arotaro (Tumblr)"
  encoder "Naomi Persephone Amethyst"
  license "CC-BY-SA-4.0"
  render-license "CC0-1.0"
  date "2018-12-27"
  source "https://web.archive.org/web/20190217140718/https://arotaro.tumblr.com/post/181471420831"
  note "Designer's own Tumblr post, read from the Wayback snapshot above (February 2019): 'I tried my hand at making an allosexual aromantic flag', after it was well received on the Arocalypse forum. The page dates it 12/27 without a year; the snapshot's date makes that 27 December 2018. Its tags say 'feel free to use this if you want'."
  note "The post names the bars and meanings: green for the aromantic community and light green for lack of attraction, both kept the same as the aromantic flag's; white for diversity of sexuality; light gold for relationships; gold for inherent wholeness and worth. It gives no hex values or proportion."
  note "Colors were read from the post's flag image (the 500 by 333 PNG Tumblr served, fetched through the Wayback Machine): #3da542, #a8d379, #ffffff, #fae34b, #e8ba00, with five equal bars of 66 or 67 pixels. The greens are within one step of those in aromantic-pride-flag. The proportion 3:2 is the image's."
}
palette {
  green "#3da542"
  light-green "#a8d379"
  white "#ffffff"
  light-gold "#fae34b"
  gold "#e8ba00"
}
proportion hoist=2 fly=3

bars green light-green white light-gold gold
